ew__navigation__item__link dropdown-toggle" data-toggle="dropdown" role="button" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Energie</a><div class="dropdown-menu bdew__dropdown"><div class="container bdew__dropdown__inner"><div class="row"><div class="bdew__dropdown__close-btn"><span class="icon-close bdew__icon"></span></div><div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12"><h3 class="bdew__headline--small--darkbold bdew__dropdown__title">Dossiers</h3><p class="bdew__dropdown__para">
